# No Arbitrary Tailwind Values

Never use Tailwind arbitrary values `[value]` for spacing, typography, or layout.

## Use Semantic Utilities from globals.css

All design tokens live in `globals.css`. Use these utilities directly:

- **Layout:** `w-form`, `w-content`, `max-w-content`, `w-sidebar`, `w-column`, `w-action`
- **Typography:** `text-page-title`, `text-card-title`, `text-small`, `text-small-medium`, `text-small-semibold`, `text-small-leading`, `text-caption-leading`, `text-form-label`, `text-kpi`, `text-score`, `text-hero`, `text-badge`, `text-section-header-large`
- **Spacing:** `page-padding`, `section-gap`, `card-content-padding`, `card-header-padding`, `tip-banner-padding`, `footer-padding`, `table-cell-padding`
- **Radius:** `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`, `card-base`

## Allowed

- Standard Tailwind scale: `gap-1`–`gap-12`, `p-1`–`p-12`, `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`
- Semantic utilities from `globals.css` (see design-tokens-reference.mdc)

## Forbidden

- `p-[13px]`, `w-[900px]`, `text-[22px]`, `rounded-[10px]`, `h-[304px]`, `max-w-[420px]`
- Any `[value]` for spacing, typography, width, height, or radius

## Exceptions

- **`globals.css`** — Arbitrary values allowed only here to define the design scale (e.g. in `@utility` blocks)
- **`@/components/shared/resume-form-card`** — `INPUT_CLASS` for resume form inputs
- shadcn/Radix component internals (e.g. `rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),8px)]`)
- Complex asymmetric radius (e.g. chat bubbles) — prefer `rounded-xl rounded-bl-md` over `rounded-[12px_12px_12px_4px]`
